<title>USA: ITC Deltacom Inc sells $200 mln 144a snr notes.</title>
<headline>ITC Deltacom Inc sells $200 mln 144a snr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from ITC Deltacom Inc was priced in the 144A private placement market on Thursday via Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc, according market sources.</p>
<p>ITC provides facilities-based regional long distance services in the southern United States.</p>
<p>BORROWER ITC DELTACOM INC</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 11.00 PCT  MATURITY 6/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 12/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 11.00 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD +434 BP    CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
